{"_id":"68a736128ec3d8323af14a60","nodeId":"PUzHbjwntTSj1REL_dAov","roadmapSlug":"data-engineer","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.672Z","description":"# ArgoCD\n\nArgo CD is a declarative GitOps continuous delivery tool for Kubernetes. It continuously monitors a Git repository and ensures that the state of the Kubernetes cluster matches the desired state defined in code. Argo CD is used in data engineering to manage Kubernetes-based pipeline deployments and infrastructure changes through Git.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Argo CD - Argo Project","url":"https://argo-cd.readthedocs.io/en/stable/","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf527f"},{"type":"video","title":"ArgoCD Tutorial for Beginners","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MeU5_k9ssrs","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5280"},{"type":"video","title":"What is ArgoCD","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p-kAqxuJNik","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5281"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:02:58.294Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417044","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Engineer in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/WOP6XG"},{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417100","title":"DataCamp - Data Engineer in Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/JkYLbr"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-engineer/content/PUzHbjwntTSj1REL_dAov.md"}